        {
          "id": "01",
          "slug": "problem",
          "visualType": "problem",
          "chapterId": "problem",
          "chapterTitle": "为什么会重来",
          "cues": [],
          "modelState": "db-committed",
          "modelStages": [
            "db-committed"
          ],
          "causalFocus": "Kafka恢复主因果",
          "resetFrom": null,
          "durationInFrames": 439,
          "voice": [
            {
              "localStart": 12,
              "localEnd": 252
            },
            {
              "localStart": 264,
              "localEnd": 404
            }
          ],
          "subtitles": [
            {
              "text": "订单七零四二只发出一条积分事件，账户已经加了十分，重启后为什么又加一次？",
              "from": 12,
              "to": 251
            },
            {
              "text": "沿着同一条记录，看看消费者究竟从哪里继续。",
              "from": 264,
              "to": 403
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "02",
          "slug": "one-record",
          "visualType": "one-record",
          "chapterId": "problem",
          "chapterTitle": "为什么会重来",
          "cues": [],
          "modelState": "one-appended",
          "modelStages": [
            "one-appended"
          ],
          "causalFocus": "Kafka恢复主因果",
          "resetFrom": "one-appended",
          "durationInFrames": 499,
          "voice": [
            {
              "localStart": 12,
              "localEnd": 205
            },
            {
              "localStart": 217,
              "localEnd": 464
            }
          ],
          "subtitles": [
            {
              "text": "生产者只把这条事件写入一次，零号位置保存着订单和加分内容。",
              "from": 12,
              "to": 204
            },
            {
              "text": "消费者读取记录不会把它从日志里取走；只要仍在保留范围内，它还能再次被读取。",
              "from": 217,
              "to": 463
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "03",
          "slug": "first-poll",
          "visualType": "first-poll",
          "chapterId": "positions",
          "chapterTitle": "读取与恢复位置",
          "cues": [],
          "modelState": "a-position-installed",
          "modelStages": [
            "a-position-installed",
            "a-fetch-sent",
            "a-polled"
          ],
          "causalFocus": "Kafka恢复主因果",
          "resetFrom": null,
          "durationInFrames": 412,
          "voice": [
            {
              "localStart": 12,
              "localEnd": 165
            },
            {
              "localStart": 177,
              "localEnd": 377
            }
          ],
          "subtitles": [
            {
              "text": "消费者甲从零开始请求，拿到的就是这条零号记录。",
              "from": 12,
              "to": 164
            },
            {
              "text": "客户端随即把内存里的下一读取位置推进到一，表示下一次往后读。",
              "from": 177,
              "to": 376
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "04",
          "slug": "two-positions",
          "visualType": "two-positions",
          "chapterId": "positions",
          "chapterTitle": "读取与恢复位置",
          "cues": [],
          "modelState": "a-polled",
          "modelStages": [
            "a-polled"
          ],
          "causalFocus": "Kafka恢复主因果",
          "resetFrom": null,
          "durationInFrames": 479,
          "voice": [
            {
              "localStart": 12,
              "localEnd": 192
            },
            {
              "localStart": 204,
              "localEnd": 444
            }
          ],
          "subtitles": [
            {
              "text": "但这个一只是甲的内存读取进度，不是已经保存的重启起点。",
              "from": 12,
              "to": 191
            },
            {
              "text": "Kafka另外保存同组的已提交位置，本例仍是零，只有提交进度才会改变它。",
              "from": 204,
              "to": 443
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "05",
          "slug": "database-commit",
          "visualType": "database-commit",
          "chapterId": "positions",
          "chapterTitle": "读取与恢复位置",
          "cues": [],
          "modelState": "first-db-pending",
          "modelStages": [
            "first-db-pending",
            "db-committed"
          ],
          "causalFocus": "Kafka恢复主因果",
          "resetFrom": null,
          "durationInFrames": 472,
          "voice": [
            {
              "localStart": 12,
              "localEnd": 192
            },
            {
              "localStart": 204,
              "localEnd": 437
            }
          ],
          "subtitles": [
            {
              "text": "甲把事件交给积分业务，数据库给账户加十分，并成功提交。",
              "from": 12,
              "to": 191
            },
            {
              "text": "数据库已经完成了自己的事务，可Kafka的恢复位置还没提交，仍然是零。",
              "from": 204,
              "to": 436
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "06",
          "slug": "crash-gap",
          "visualType": "crash-gap",
          "chapterId": "replay",
          "chapterTitle": "同一记录怎样重来",
          "cues": [],
          "modelState": "db-committed",
          "modelStages": [
